"name": "ID Logistics Group",
"description": "ID Logistics Group engages in the provision of contract logistics services. It offers warehousing and transportation optimization solutions, and value-added services like packaging, cross-docking, and quality control. It operates in the following sectors: dry food, general non-food, fresh produce, electronics-high technology, cosmetics, beverages, fashion and electronic business. The company was founded by Eric H\u00e9mar and Christophe Satin on September 12, 2001 and is headquartered in Orgon, France.",
